    prompt: 'Clean low-resolution pixel art for a top-down action roguelike: tiles
      are 16 x 16 pixels, characters 16 to 20 pixels tall, every pixel a big visible
      square. One limited palette for everything (soft greens, warm tans, cool dark
      grey stone, a dark navy outline), each material shaded with 2 to 4 flat tones,
      simple bold readable shapes, clean 1-pixel dark outlines, light from the top-left,
      no gradients, no noise, no dithering texture, no fine detail. Straight top-down
      3/4 view with the grid aligned to the screen (never isometric).'
